    documentation="https://www.efront.com/en&#xA;&#xA;eFront is a leading alternative investment management and fund administration software platform &#xA;owned by BlackRock and integrated with the Aladdin platform.&#xA;&#xA;What eFront Does&#xA;&#x9;• Alternative Asset Coverage: Manages private equity, real estate, infrastructure, private debt, and fund-of-funds.&#xA;&#x9;• Fund Accounting &amp; Administration: Automates complex calculations like carried interest, waterfall models, capital calls, &#xA;&#x9;   and distributions.&#xA;&#x9;• Whole Portfolio Integration: Unifies public and private market data by combining eFront with BlackRock's &#xA;&#x9;   Aladdin ecosystem for institutional investors, banks, and insurers.&#xA;&#x9;• Core Modules: Offers tools like eFront Invest GP for general partners, eFront Office for deal flow, and &#xA;  &#x9;   eFront Insight for ESG metrics and benchmarking.&#xA;">
